# perf_worst.jsc - worst-case frames: low among islands with clouds overhead, full boost, then
# a crash explosion (particles, spray, debris, smoke).
# EASY assist keeps the jet on its terrain floor (max ground ahead + 6 u), so it skims the
# terraces instead of hitting the first one; `cmd x` then forces the crash at a known time.
# Checks (DESIGN.md section 21): world march steps <= 180 and samples <= 25k per frame;
# esp_est world <= 6.0 ms, jet <= 2.5 ms, fx <= 1.5 ms (maxima over the whole scenario; the
# cost model is fitted to the device, where 60 fps holds while core-1 work stays <= ~16.5 ms;
# device bench maxima: wld 4.7, jet 2.1, fx 0.8).
0     persist assist 0
0     view 0
0     state title
+0    state free
+0.5  seek land 14 220 cloudy
+0    resetmax
+0.1  hold SPACE 3
+1.0  shot low_boost
+1.0  shot islands_close
+0.1  cmd x                   # force crash + respawn: explosion particles
+0    wait state == CRASH 2
+0.3  shot crash_particles
+0.4  shot crash_smoke
+0    assert max_steps <= 180
+0    assert max_samples <= 25000
+0    assert max_esp_wld <= 6.0
+0    assert max_esp_jet <= 2.5
+0    assert max_esp_fx <= 1.5
+0    assert max_empty_px == 0
+0    sheet perf_worst 4
+0    end
